# PickOne Cursor Compatibility Entrypoint

The repository's canonical agent entrypoint is `AGENTS.md`. Read it before work.
Follow `PRODUCT.md` for product behavior and `ENGINEERING.md` for technical
invariants. Before writing or reviewing Swift, read
`.agents/skills/apply-pickone-swift-style/SKILL.md`. Use the relevant workflow in
`.agents/skills/`; `.cursor/skills/` provides Cursor compatibility entrypoints.
